  specialEffectName: Piosis
  desc_tactics: 'Whisper likes to stay on the frontline, countering attacks, applying
    damage over time with his Decay, as well as dealing burst damage to his enemies.
    Most of his actions - including his starter Psychic Dagger - grant him a stack
    of Psiosis, which Mind Rend will consume to apply more Decay stacks. Whisper
    makes himself a target to avoid with Phantom Creature, which Riposte enemy attacks
    with a chance to Stun his attackers. Or he can make an enemy Vulnerable with
    Dark Passover to be focused by his allies. He also has Void Push to clear enemies
    from the frontline, and put them in range for Necrotic Eruption. Necrotic Eruption
    consumes all Decay stacks and deals damage to the enemy while healing himself,
    based on the amount of stacks it had. It also applies Critical Exposed to the
    enemy afterward, opening opportunities for his allies to do even more damage.
    He can be a powerful opponent for bosses and captains if he had the time to set
    up. '
  desc_about: 'Whisper Lore Whisper Lore Whisper Lore Whisper Lore Whisper Lore Whisper
    Lore Whisper Lore Whisper Lore Whisper Lore Whisper Lore Whisper Lore '
